.TH geectl-remote-repo-remove 1  "geectl-remote-repo-remove 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-repo\-remove \- Remove a repository from a project. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the removal. Removing a repository that is not there succeeds
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote repo\-remove\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove a repository from a project. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the removal. Removing a repository that is not there succeeds
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project to remove the repository from
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
The repository name
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
